.TH "notcurses\-tester" "1" "v3.0.17" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
notcurses\-tester \- Notcurses unit testing
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\f[B]notcurses\-tester\f[R]\ [\f[B]\-p\ datadir\f[R]] [\f[B]\-lN\f[R]]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\f[B]notcurses\-tester\f[R] drives the several hundred unit tests
included with Notcurses.
It requires several data files installed alongside Notcurses; if these
are in an irregular location, supply \f[B]\-p\f[R].
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\f[B]\-p\f[R] \f[B]\f[BI]path\f[B]\f[R]: Look in the specified
\f[B]\f[BI]path\f[B]\f[R] for data files.
.PP
\f[B]\-lN\f[R]: Enable diagnostics/logging at level
\f[B]\f[BI]N\f[B]\f[R].
\f[B]\f[BI]N\f[B]\f[R] must be between \-1 and 7.
.SH "نکات (NOTES)"
Valid \f[B]TERM\f[R] and \f[B]LANG\f[R] environment variables are
necessary for \f[B]notcurses\-tester\f[R]\[aq]s correct operation.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\f[B]notcurses(3)\f[R]
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
nick black \c
.MT nickblack@linux.com
.ME \c.
